{"id":"1e7389aa-1edf-4c86-a810-0b82067fd89d","object":"response","created_at":1793866389,"status":"completed","background":false,"completed_at":1793866391,"content_filters":null,"error":null,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"incomplete_details":null,"instructions":null,"max_output_tokens":4000,"max_tool_calls":null,"model":"deepseek-flash","moderation":null,"output":[{"type":"message","id":"c830fa5d-f00f-4580-a37d-6b71eb6e0730","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"{\"failure_scope\":\"本课主播放器的 13 帧（f00–f12）只演示成功路径：两次分配（t0、t1）都成功，两次第 5 行 if (p == NULL) 的 NULL 条件都被求值且结果均为假，随后继续写入数据、连接并返回，最后调用者接收返回值。掩码关闭导致不分配的分支（allocation_success 为 0 时 p 为 NULL）以及真实的 malloc 失败，都没有在这 13 帧中演示；代码静态上含有该分支，只说明代码具备这种能力，不等于本课演示了该分支。当 p 为 NULL 时，第 5 行 if (p == NULL) return head; 会直接返回传入的旧 head，调用者拿回原链表，不会写入 p->data 或 p->next。需要区分两种“看不到新节点”的情形：分配失败时函数返回旧 head，本来就没有新节点；分配成功但调用者丢弃返回值时，新节点确实存在却不可达。本课不证明任意 C 代码的内存安全，也不执行代码。\",\"paragraph_5\":{\"text\":\"如果调用者写成 insert(caller_head, value, 1) 而丢弃返回值，函数内部照样完成了分配和连接，新节点也确实指向了旧首节点，但 caller_head 这个变量从未被更新，仍然指向原来的首节点。于是从 caller_head 出发只能看到旧链表，新分配的节点虽然存在、却没有任何从入口可达的指针指向它，成为不可达节点。这不是分配失败，而是返回值被丢弃造成的入口未更新。\",\"fact_ids\":[\"head_evidence_v1.discard_return_comparison\"]}}"}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":null,"reasoning":{"effort":"none","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":0.2,"text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"edumind_head_evidence_revision","schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"failure_scope":{"maxLength":4000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"paragraph_5":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"fact_ids":{"items":{"enum":["head_evidence_v1.discard_return_comparison"],"type":"string"},"maxItems":1,"minItems":1,"type":"array","uniqueItems":true},"text":{"maxLength":4000,"minLength":1,"t